OL,3,AJohn Healey to say UK economy is
OL,4,A'turning the corner' in first speech as
OL,5,Achancellor
OL,6,
OL,7,FChancellor John Healey is expected to
OL,8,Fsay the UK economy is "turning the
OL,9,Fcorner" in his first major speech since
OL,10,Ftaking the role - you'll be able to
OL,11,Fwatch live at the top of the page from
OL,12,F09:30 BST
OL,14,FThe speech comes after UK borrowing
OL,15,Fcosts rose again last week, with
OL,16,Finterest rates on 10-year debt reaching
OL,17,Fan 18-year high
OL,19,FHealey will deliver his first Budget on
OL,20,F28 October - which, he says, will be
OL,21,F"built on fiscal discipline"
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,107,105,200,300,0,100
